.entire/logs/entire.log:57:{"time":"2026-06-16T01:56:37.473949-04:00","level":"INFO","msg":"attribution calculated","session_id":"5dbcd2da-0a2d-488a-a2e6-1d63a2b98e94","component":"attribution","agent_lines":14,"human_added":3,"human_modified":0,"human_removed":0,"total_committed":17,"agent_percentage":83.33333333333334,"accumulated_user_ad…252144 tokens truncated…amp":"2026-06-16T19:27:30.569Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/peytonmontei/trail-demo-video/HANDOFF.md","content":"# Trail demo video — session handoff (Claude → Codex)\n\n## 1. Task overview\nBuild two Remotion videos that contrast a **GitHub PR** vs an **Entire Trail** for the same\nagent-written change (\"Add colors to trail priority labels\", PR #2391 / Trail #1347).\n- **TrailDemoShort** — highlight cut (~89s)\n- **TrailDemoFull** — tutorial cut (~3:05), uses the longer full-length clip takes\nBoth 1920×1080, 30fps. Project root: `~/trail-demo-video` (Remotion 4.0.477, React 19).\n\n## 2. Current state\n**Files**\n- `src/Root.tsx` — registers `TrailDemoShort` + `TrailDemoFull`.\n- `src/Short.tsx`, `src/Full.tsx` — scene arrays. Short uses `TransitionSeries` + `fade()`;\n  Full likewise. Each scene `{ d: <frames>, el: <component/> }`.\n- `src/components/Cards.tsx` — `TrailsIntro`, `TitleCard`, `Outro`.\n- `src/components/Stage.tsx` — `Clip` (OffthreadVideo, `trimBefore`).\n- `src/EntireLogo.tsx`, `src/theme.ts`.\n- `public/` — clip mp4s, `trails-title.png` (4K), `trails-background.png`, `brand/*` (logo reveal mp4\n  + `outro-logo.png` still), `audio/start-up.mp3`, `audio/plop.mp3`.\n\n**Short scenes (frames @30fps):** intro 75 · card \"The pull request\" 60 · `clip-1-full` 430 ·\ncard \"The same change, in a Trail\" 90 · `clip-2-short-this-one` 949 · card \"The fix\" 60 ·\n`clip-3-full` 181 · card \"The Trail, after\" 90 · `clip-4-short` 616 · outro 270.\n\n**Full scenes:** intro 90 · card 80 · `clip-1-full` 430 · card 80 · `clip-2-full` 3118 · card 80 ·\n`clip-3-full` 181 · card 80 · `clip-4-full` 1332 · outro 210.\n\n**Render command (use the binary directly — `pnpm exec` errors with a deps-status check):**\n```bash\ncd ~/trail-demo-video\n./node_modules/.bin/remotion render TrailDemoShort out/trail-demo-short.mp4 --pixel-format=yuv420p --log=error\n# then ALWAYS re-encode (see discovery #1):\nffmpeg -y -i out/trail-demo-short.mp4 -vf \"scale=in_range=full:out_range=tv\" \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 18 -preset medium -pix_fmt yuv420p -color_range tv \\\n  -colorspace bt709 -color_primaries bt709 -color_trc bt709 -movflags +faststart out/_s.mp4 \\\n  && mv out/_s.mp4 out/trail-demo-short.mp4\n```\n\n## 3. Important discoveries (gotchas — do not relearn the hard way)\n1. **Pixel format:** Remotion output is `yuvj420p`, which QuickTime renders as a solid black/white\n   screen. Always re-encode the final mp4 to `yuv420p` tv-range + `+faststart` (command above).\n2. **OffthreadVideo past-end = glitch:** a Sequence `durationInFrames` GREATER than the clip's real\n   frame count renders garbage/dark frames. Always set clip durations ≤ `nb_read_frames`\n   (`ffprobe -count_frames`). This caused the clip-4 \"glitch.\"\n3. **Outro reveal is 50fps** (`brand/Entire_Logo+Wordmark_Reveal_0129_white.mp4`, 7.02s). Use\n   `OffthreadVideo` (NOT classic `<Video>`) or it stutters. To hold the logo past 7s, the Outro\n   swaps to the still `brand/outro-logo.png` at frame ≥205 (avoids past-end glitch).\n4. **No-jump intro→card:** intro AND cards share the same `trails-background.png` via `<Img>`\n   (skill rule: never CSS `background-image`); the `trails` wordmark + Entire logo are composited on\n   top in `TrailsIntro`. Different-aspect images caused a visible jump before this.\n5. Clips are transcoded `scale=1920:1080:force_original_aspect_ratio=increase,crop=1920:1080,fps=30`,\n   `yuv420p`, into `public/`.\n\n## 4. Conventions / user preferences (IMPORTANT)\n- **Match the other demos** at `~/Documents/entire/devenv/remotion-demos` (intro card style, dark\n  `Entire` logo-reveal outro).\n- **Follow** the Remotion best-practices skill at\n  `~/Documents/entire/devenv/remotion-demos/.agents/skills/remotion-best-practices/` (read its rules).\n- **Title cards:** system font, **regular weight (400)** — NOT bold. Words **slide in** (spring\n  `damping:200`); the **screen does not slide/swipe** (transitions are `fade()` crossfades only).\n- **Clips play at FULL length — do NOT trim any clip** unless explicitly told.\n- Short and Full intentionally have **different endings** (Full's `clip-4-full` is longer — approve\n  lingers, mouse moves toward top; Short's `clip-4-short` is shorter). Short's outro was extended to\n  270 (held logo) to not \"end too fast\"; Full's outro is 210.\n- Workflow: render in background, then `open` the mp4; verify by extracting frames with ffmpeg and\n  viewing them. The user replaces clips by dropping new recordings on the Desktop (e.g.\n  `clip-2-short-this-one.mp4`) and asking to swap them in at full length.\n\n## 5. Next steps\n- Continue per the user's clip/timing notes (they iterate by watching and giving per-clip feedback).\n- When swapping a clip: transcode it into `public/` (command in §3), set its scene `d` to the exact\n  `nb_read_frames` (never higher), re-render, re-encode, open.\n- Music slot exists (`MUSIC` flag + `public/music.mp3`) but is off.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"28417ff9-c37c-42f1-9df5-86446c0278d7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entire.io/.worktrees/trail-demo","sessionId":"5dbcd2da-0a2d-488a-a2e6-1d63a2b98e94","version":"2.1.178","gitBranch":"demo/priority-label-colors"}
