        // checkpoints. Realistic cause: every entry for this session sits in
        // dead_session_indices on every contributing checkpoint, so
        // aggregateSession drops them. Keep envelope-derived session.{} (incl.
        // synthesised displayName from extractSessionEnvelopeMeta) and log so
        // genuine materialise bugs stay visible.
